@startuml
 title Login and token renewal
autonumber
actor user
participant "application client" as app
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "iam-service" as IAM
database Redis
database "database of data" as DB

user -> app: enters document and password
app -> GW: request of authentication
GW -> IAM: validates credentials
IAM -> DB: queries Profile (status and role)
DB --> IAM: data of the profile
alt profile inactive or credentials inválidas
  IAM --> app: error 401
else profile active and credentials valid
  IAM -> Redis: records session and revocación
  IAM --> app: Access token (1 h) and refresh token (7 days)
end
app --> user: shows result by role
...
app -> GW: requests renewal with refresh token
GW -> IAM: validates refresh token
IAM -> Redis: checks that not esté revocado
IAM --> app: new par of tokens
@enduml

